/T (The evaluation of the event was conducted by Palash Shah and Priyansh Sharma, who brought extensive expertise in software development and data-driven systems. They assessed the projects based on design accuracy, implementation logic, innovation, and clarity of presentation. Both judges interacted with every team, offering detailed feedback, suggesting improvements, and sharing real-world expectations for database-based applications. Their guidance added immense value, helping students gain deeper insights into effective project development and professional-level DBMS practices.)
